  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186096700,
      "id": "dc5bab6c-1ce7-58b5-a59d-cff2ce35ecca",
      "title": "Identifying Parallel Vectors From a Diagram"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "1779515d-b970-5dc3-a2f1-266d132230fd",
      ":question/problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/repairs/2026-10-19-checkbox-nonempty/patched-samples/17592186096700/assets/a4a9712f25a9bc89cda7837037e1051513ca8b0d10a6bd40989c18c69f0078ac.png)\n\nConsider the diagram that is shown above. Which of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $s=3t$\n\nII. $r=2p$\n\nIII. $q=-r$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "- Statement I is false. The vectors $s$ and $t$ are parallel and have the same direction. The magnitude of $s$ is $1$ times the magnitude of $t$. So, $s\\ne 3t$.\n\n- Statement II is true. The vectors $r$ and $p$ are parallel and have the same direction. The magnitude of $r$ is $2$ times the magnitude of $p$. So, $r=2p$.\n\n- Statement III is true. The vectors $q$ and $r$ are parallel and have opposite directions. The magnitude of $q$ is $1$ times the magnitude of $r$. So, $q=-r$.\n\nTherefore, only statements II and III are true.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "2166e724-4b8d-5cef-9f8a-cc06517cd5a7",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "ae1bacac-8796-5cf9-9014-638511afd97e",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II and III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "4b322213-7082-5c02-97b5-fb1bdfd9a600",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "aadad27c-6d4b-5cba-91f3-39b9aeaa9a28",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "23f085b2-7d5f-57d8-a5bb-cfe570d8f466",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "c950f189-27e5-5c80-8209-3a50810116e5",
